<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX index plunges 18.3 pts to 982.7 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX index plunges 18.3 pts to 982.7 pts.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - Czech RPIX index dives as seven of the 11 shares on the index lose ground.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX closes session down 18.3 points, or 1.83 percent, at 982.7 points.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom falls 70 crowns to 2,900.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka up nine crowns to 1,810.</p>
<p>* CEZ down 43 crowns to 905.</p>
<p>* IPB falls 21 crowns 266.</p>
<p>* Turnover 25.4 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
